 subject_lines:
   - Decide this in week 1 or lose it at day 90
-  - The two-team pilot that settled the renewal
+  - What one manager's paper log showed about AI pilots
   - A week-one checklist for your AI pilot
-preview_text: One team tracked review turnaround. The other had nothing to show the CFO.
