 ## Slide 1: Two teams, one pilot
 - on_slide: One fintech pilot. Two teams. Only one had numbers.
 - visual: Two columns labelled "Team 1" and "Team 2". Team 1 has a heading, "review turnaround". Team 2's column is empty.
