+- speaker_notes: How do you pick what to measure? Start by asking what the team expects to reach for the tool to do. If your target is built around code output and people mostly use the assistant for something else, you'll be measuring the wrong part of the job. Do this check in week one, alongside picking the measure, so the baseline you take still means something. If it turns out the measure is aimed at the wrong work, adjust it early and write down why.
